    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cdb5cef65548e7788cea2bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚刚的比赛你也看了吧？你感觉那姑娘是在认真跑吗？\r\n是不是也觉得“只要她能认真跑起来的话就行”？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a71189c7b15e4afda6f6fc4e0fa478bfb2b930c8dad370ba1969e29c49366f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b577084ba3a84074072ed3bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前辈训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "28368bc5f3c0a28228256a15f37d5afcd7aa93e7f6889b318a2b7110a64bafb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5e3797724e11a8fc84e1ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她已经放弃自己了吧。后辈，你还有自己的未来。\r\n比起徒劳地帮助她反而让彼此都撞得满头是包，还是放着她不管对你们都好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "855e0a8173d073de4abd257f941cb5b58f030a2eaf4834090ae01e8d11ac0644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0401e5266e4a287a9cf1cdba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前辈的忠告让我一时说不出话来。\r\n他曾指导过无数赛马娘，这也确是真知灼见。\r\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a46f675944e7d94e35b42dc155480ff2af33355d6dd8fa7806b2a4642a1a55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb3ddea86ff0a1441416e48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——当她离开赛道时，\r\n那表情仿佛正渴求着什么人的帮助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59b17ceec827d3de00cb8796b140525f8a424031e27825347c6dc2fda864e5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d161d21cd46ed782d9eed04b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典最近的成绩……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ac92f3c2c79a55d4fd6d21dc6e97c45d36a474ac81e45ab81063ed492fe2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855f06e32602c3e4ef894fca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她真的是前辈所说的那样吗？\r\n回过神来时，我已在不知不觉间开始收集她的资料了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe8c1368e3c25a28fcd8aaf198143ff16b0886ce2ddde86b9826f06edad30634",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27036eca8ba2267bfec7a5e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……好的时候非常好，差的时候也是差到了家。\r\n不过综合来看的话……说实话，算不上太好。\r\n但这资料……也不过只显示了她的完赛时间这一种数据而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1e15b9a8dee4a266a7aec39ca793ddaa844c2e50ca8b1cc99c5c160b9de6b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eae9404896b93738f2adc86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为何她会在选拔赛后露出那仿佛求助一般的表情？\r\n为何她完全没法拿出全部实力奔跑？\r\n——这一切的原因依旧是个谜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5d5760cf9b86f1cdb847f52839ebb899ce0fee73f4530a01e750f31ba1fb0bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5844b3a319aa6c8986f778db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……还是先去了解一下她吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c32c15710187bc305ced46a676bd6229971d8c16ff2d021511d7ec2b595f6cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5efbd4f6ac0d483e62074fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我合上眼前的资料。\r\n在这堆资料之中，找不到我想要的答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "444dca01baae463e069133a0e8cb8cdd29e6b0a130f7b585b8da037e7f49ba96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d8fae371abc755b36e1206",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她这一整周都旷课了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "514ed1e3454f19626650b716fa1ae492cd6c046179e825ec1d768a5f68178666",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf9cbbd6d84ec7582e684b1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "混混头子",
      "source_fingerprint": "489c6d26e0a0b95db27135fcbb60acecd1331f469d828472ef432c80559285fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530a126f6e492b7e22a61e58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别他妈成天来找我啊！\r\n你想了解中山的话去找她本人不就行了吗！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c01d6490f0ba6a12e62375f65ad92416bc797a9a201dee45011b0328149abd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167741eefecc8af1fe467a24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "混混头子",
      "source_fingerprint": "489c6d26e0a0b95db27135fcbb60acecd1331f469d828472ef432c80559285fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
