    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08bad99ca5d119f2b3f24a5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我管你啊！\r\n操……你别跟过来！这么大人了，少来恶心我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2210aa74db33038f757894d582acb8acceaf130a9f031b4233173e536bea0df4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61aa892848d56b365e9cd0b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前辈也看看她的表现吧，一定会大吃一惊的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f833b467db05e70ef2f0a1c429e746a88d6415a69d83f7d2b52d97b204632d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
