    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8741b84c82f27f4b229a3e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "噢……嗯？中山庆典……？\r\n嘶……总觉得好像在哪儿听过这名字，哪儿来着……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17db528865548194078fd5eb003f03c6db20e9f41e3de096fad54c2c84fe523",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
