    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e61a7ee239004d03eb2ad95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你就是最近到处『中山』『中山』地喊着的那个训练员？\r\n不管是学校还是后巷里，你都快成都市传说了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "230fa486f4f4a75aa4ceb02b5c84f6fec91483c347ff563e80b364e8a557101c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35232366e239ec2de2216252",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
