    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c51d0a5f3621b906728d7d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行了，赶紧摇着尾巴跟过来吧。\r\n我赏你点儿你想要的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ef67e2665b8a6b6431d97fe8cd0301f508ebf1b81d6f112e4a2211ffd259922",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
