    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb4a273e451128840eca928",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也是少数几个和野草更合得来的家伙的栖身之地。\r\n中山好像也在这地方撒过欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c89fedd7c9ea36b7639585180f685de1820c9b27359d3f33b1b82c6fc776a99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38a4e26fe39b18531444e97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9fce63820572a87a806d5f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你没听我说话吗？是撒『过』欢。\r\n现在倒没怎么在这里跑过。\r\n而且，她最近——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6488cf794ae06ef378e9a6ca94515629725efb78782247dde9beb373dee7281",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af88b92f45d48897b05ff46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994db4bdea81cacb57ca792f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真稀奇啊，你居然还在宿舍里。今晚不打算出去玩？\r\n我亲爱的室友不是只喜欢和人一决高下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "26cb47c002c166c95e0af36097afd66e2afc8a7a586db5d0644fed959f960ae4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3c3c5f69f80597ae9d58c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e855e6960f5795c9361f9927",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我在准备选拔赛。\r\n所以这段时间把那些事情都戒了。就这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc5de3c2315ca953659bf8c56bee96bc3336d8c95f205724f5658a2c1987c33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
