    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd70b70ac9d132fa4847fac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2002599a1378454bbdab84a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后要面对的可是“比赛”啊。靠得住的只有自己的力量，\r\n是场能让人彻底沉迷其中、对赌徒而言最棒的搏命之地。\r\n……所以，不需要别的东西了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "320f9a825367b11ba3e50336cdb001941e66fef5d5e91455969458baabf7290e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5825b8d47c6ff1a35e3934d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前几天我曾见过她的表现。那时候她所展现出的身体能力与胆量都是一等一的。\r\n若是她能在选拔赛中发挥出那时候的实力的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6fc58884e31133386685e7b528dab50a420418c68ea71db3bd48af846710ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1113a525fbe313916649733f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
