    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c5808a6d79715b47bb651b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那群擅自跟在我屁股后面摇尾巴的家伙里，有个人是中山的老同学。\r\n那家伙给我奉上了这条情报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6669e17dab4045806b33a9e5ca9a34b020ee960eac64402869232b5a4965dc2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
