    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d5b0762b171fe298ec9fa5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是中山庆典的主治医师吗？\r\n难道她已经重病缠身了？我满心不安地走向医院——\r\n【译注：老师、医生的日语都是“先生（せんせい）”】",
      "source_fingerprint": "683d3a6d7077170a5cddbf61d94850319b3e235b538f6a25648a1585afdb3ad5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
